{"articleNo":"91524","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=91524&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업]2013년도 취업동아리 추가모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.09.11","hit":"3444","attachments":[{"name":"취업동아리 신청 구비서류(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=91524&attachNo=72594"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">▣ </span></span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 신청요건<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 구성요건<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">본교 재적생 및 미취업 졸업생 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명 이상으로 구성되어야 함(대학원생 제외)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">휴학생 및 미취업 졸업생은 구성원의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">20% </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하로 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업 및 진로와 관련하여 뚜렷한 목적성이 있어야 함</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 구성분야<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">특정기업 및 그룹사의 진출<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">특정 업</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">직종의 진출<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 취업과 관련된 분야<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">외국어 학습</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공 관련 스터디 등 취업과 직접적인 관련이 없는 분야는 제외<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: <strong><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 09. 12(목</font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 2013. 09. 23(월)</span></font></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font color=\"#ff0000\"> 09:00~18:00<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">동아리대표가 구비서류 작성 후 취업지원본부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">도서관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">210</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">호</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">로 방문접수<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구비서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업동아리 등록신청서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동계획서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회원명부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">붙임 참조</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#2d629c\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"\"><strong>▣ </strong></font></span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><font face=\"\">지원기간</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;동아리 선정 완료 시 ~ 2014년 1월 <br><br></span></span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">▣ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #2d629c; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타사항<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">문의처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">취업지원본부 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">☎</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">054-478-7983</span><br><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
